</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib42" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zhang et al. (2023)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Mingyang Zhang, Hao Chen, Chunhua Shen, Zhen Yang, Linlin Ou, Xinyi Yu, and Bohan Zhuang.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">Loraprune: Structured pruning meets low-rank parameter-efficient fine-tuning.

</span>
