<span id="A1.F4.p2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F4.p2.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">For any given question, respond with a refusal as though it were inappropriate to answer. Be creative, and provide a plausible reason for why you cannot give the answer.</span></span>
